{"id": "GVm_xXIskgmH", "owner": "showcase", "title": "PORTAL — Cross-chain bridge · Ethereum → Robinhood Chain", "createdAt": 1790349706440, "updatedAt": 1790349878592, "versions": [{"prompt": "Cross-chain bridge app \"PORTAL\" — swap card from Ethereum to Robinhood Chain with token selectors, route visualization with glowing path, recent transfers. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>PORTAL — Cross-chain bridge · Ethereum → Robinhood Chain</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#0b050a;\n  --bg-2:#11070f;\n  --green:#6414ff;\n  --blue:#ff5b7f;\n  --ink:#fee8ff;\n  --muted:#967e94;\n  --line:rgba(100,20,255,.16);\n  --line-2:rgba(255,91,127,.18);\n  --card:rgba(20,9,18,.72);\n  --r:14px;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{max-width:100%;overflow-x:hidden}\nbody{\n  margin:0;\n  background:var(--bg);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  position:relative;\n}\n/* ---------- texture layers ---------- */\nbody::before{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(760px 520px at 78% 8%, rgba(255,91,127,.16), transparent 62%),\n    radial-gradient(680px 620px at 8% 82%, rgba(100,20,255,.13), transparent 64%),\n    radial-gradient(900px 700px at 50% -10%, rgba(100,20,255,.07), transparent 70%),\n    linear-gradient(180deg,#0b050a 0%, #10060e 55%, #0b050a 100%);\n}\nbody::after{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;opacity:.5;\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(11,5,10,.9), transparent 12%, transparent 88%, rgba(11,5,10,.9));\n  mix-blend-mode:overlay;\n}\n.grid-tex{\n  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.55;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(100,20,255,.055) 1px, transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(100,20,255,.055) 1px, transparent 1px);\n  background-size:36px 36px;\n  mask-image:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #000000 0%, transparent 78%);\n  -webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #000000 0%, transparent 78%);\n}\nmain,header,footer{position:relative;z-index:2}\n.wrap{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}\na{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace}\n\n/* ---------- header ---------- */\nheader{\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\n  background:rgba(11,5,10,.6);\n  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\n  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;\n}\n.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;height:68px}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}\n.brand .mark{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(100,20,255,.55))}\n.brand b{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.24em;font-weight:700}\n.nav-links{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-left:18px}\n.nav-links a{font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);transition:color .2s, text-shadow .2s}\n.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.on{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(100,20,255,.6)}\n.nav-right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\n.chip{\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;\n  padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);\n  background:rgba(100,20,255,.04);\n}\n.dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);animation:pulse 2s infinite}\n@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}\n.btn{\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--green);color:#0b0410;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#7f3cff,#540fd9);\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(100,20,255,.25), 0 0 26px rgba(100,20,255,.35);\n  cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s, box-shadow .25s, filter .2s;\n}\n.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(100,20,255,.4), 0 0 42px rgba(100,20,255,.6)}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--blue);border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:none}\n.btn.ghost:hover{box-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(255,91,127,.3);color:#ffbfce}\n.burger{display:none}\n\n/* ---------- hero ---------- */\n.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 68px);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:46px 0 34px}\n.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;width:100%}\n.eyebrow{\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n  font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);\n  border:1px solid var(--line-2);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,91,127,.05);\n}\nh1{\n  font-size:clamp(42px,5.3vw,74px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:700;\n  margin:24px 0 0;text-transform:uppercase;\n}\nh1 .glow{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(100,20,255,.45)}\nh1 .out{\n  color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.4px rgba(255,91,127,.75);\n  text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,91,127,.25);\n}\n.lede{max-width:468px;color:#b69fb6;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.65;margin:26px 0 0}\n.terminal{\n  margin-top:30px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(17,7,15,.7);\n  padding:14px 16px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);\n  max-width:468px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 40px rgba(100,20,255,.04);\n}\n.terminal span{color:var(--green)}\n.terminal .b{color:var(--blue)}\n.caret{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:13px;background:var(--green);vertical-align:-2px;animation:pulse 1.1s steps(1) infinite;box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--green)}\n.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:38px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;max-width:520px}\n.stat{background:#0f060d;padding:18px 16px}\n.stat b{display:block;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.stat b.blue{color:var(--blue)}\n.stat b.green{color:var(--green)}\n.stat span{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n\n/* ---------- swap card ---------- */\n.card{\n  position:relative;border:1px solid rgba(100,20,255,.26);border-radius:20px;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(23,10,21,.92), rgba(13,6,11,.94));\n  padding:22px;\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(11,5,10,.9), 0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.65), 0 0 60px rgba(100,20,255,.14);\n  backdrop-filter:blur(6px);\n}\n.card::before{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-1px;border-radius:21px;pointer-events:none;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(100,20,255,.5), transparent 32%, transparent 68%, rgba(255,91,127,.45));\n  -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000000 0 0);\n  -webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;padding:1px;\n}\n.card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px}\n.card-head h2{margin:0;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:3px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n.tab{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:6px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;transition:.2s}\n.tab.on{background:rgba(100,20,255,.14);color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(100,20,255,.2) inset}\n\n.panel{\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(9,3,8,.7);\n  padding:15px 16px;transition:border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;\n}\n.panel:focus-within{border-color:rgba(100,20,255,.45);box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(100,20,255,.12)}\n.panel.to:focus-within{border-color:rgba(255,91,127,.45)}\n.panel-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n.panel-top .net{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:#cfb9cf}\n.panel-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\n.amt{\n  flex:1;min-width:0;background:transparent;border:0;outline:0;color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;width:100%;\n}\n.amt::placeholder{color:#462f44}\n.amt.read{color:var(--blue);text-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(255,91,127,.35)}\n.panel-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:10px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}\n.max{border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(100,20,255,.06);color:var(--green);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}\n.max:hover{box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(100,20,255,.35)}\n\n/* selector */\n.sel{position:relative;flex:0 0 auto}\n.sel-btn{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);\n  border-radius:999px;padding:7px 12px 7px 8px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;\n  font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:.2s;white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.sel-btn:hover{border-color:rgba(100,20,255,.45);box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(100,20,255,.18)}\n.sel-btn svg.cv{opacity:.6}\n.tkn{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#110411;flex:0 0 auto}\n.menu{\n  position:absolute;right:0;top:calc(100% + 8px);width:238px;z-index:30;\n  background:#0f060d;border:1px solid rgba(100,20,255,.28);border-radius:12px;padding:6px;\n  box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.7), 0 0 40px rgba(100,20,255,.14);\n  display:none;\n}\n.menu.open{display:block;animation:drop .16s ease-out}\n@keyframes drop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n.menu li{list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}\n.menu li:hover{background:rgba(100,20,255,.1)}\n.menu li small{margin-left:auto;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted)}\n.menu ul{margin:0;padding:0}\n.menu .mhead{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 10px 4px}\n\n/* flip */\n.flip-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:-11px 0;position:relative;z-index:5}\n.flip{\n  width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;\n  background:#140812;border:1px solid rgba(100,20,255,.4);color:var(--green);\n  box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(100,20,255,.25);transition:transform .35s ease, box-shadow .25s;\n}\n.flip:hover{box-shadow:0 0 38px rgba(100,20,255,.5)}\n.flip.spin{transform:rotate(180deg)}\n\n/* route */\n.route{margin-top:18px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(16,4,6,.6);padding:16px 16px 12px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.route-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n.route-head b{color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.14em}\n.route svg{display:block;width:100%;height:88px;margin-top:4px}\n.node-label{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;fill:#b69fb6;text-transform:uppercase}\n.node-label.hi{fill:var(--green)}\n\n.details{margin-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.1);padding-top:13px;display:grid;gap:9px}\n.drow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}\n.drow b{color:#e8cfe7;font-weight:500}\n.drow b.g{color:var(--green)}\n.cta{width:100%;margin-top:18px;padding:16px;font-size:13px;border-radius:12px}\n.note{margin-top:11px;text-align:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7a5d79;text-transform:uppercase}\n\n/* ---------- marquee ---------- */\n.marquee{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(10,4,9,.7);overflow:hidden}\n.mq-track{display:flex;gap:44px;white-space:nowrap;padding:12px 0;animation:mq 34s linear infinite;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted)}\n.mq-track span b{color:var(--green)}\n.mq-track span i{color:var(--blue);font-style:normal}\n@keyframes mq{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}\n\n/* ---------- transfers ---------- */\nsection.transfers{padding:84px 0 96px}\n.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:28px}\n.sec-head h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,42px);letter-spacing:-.03em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1}\n.sec-head p{margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.filters{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.table{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(14,6,13,.65)}\n.thead,.trow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1.5fr 1fr .9fr .8fr;gap:16px;padding:14px 22px;align-items:center}\n.thead{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);background:rgba(100,20,255,.05);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.trow{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);transition:background .2s}\n.trow:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.trow:hover{background:rgba(100,20,255,.05)}\n.hash{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:#ffbfce}\n.hash small{display:block;color:#7a5d79;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:3px}\n.path{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:#e8cfe7}\n.path .arrow{color:var(--green);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n.amount{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px}\n.amount small{color:var(--muted);display:block;font-size:10.5px;margin-top:3px}\n.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;border:1px solid}\n.badge.ok{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(100,20,255,.35);background:rgba(100,20,255,.07)}\n.badge.live{color:var(--blue);border-color:rgba(255,91,127,.35);background:rgba(255,91,127,.07)}\n.badge.live .dot{background:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--blue)}\n.time{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right}\n.bar{height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);overflow:hidden;margin-top:7px}\n.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--green));box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,91,127,.7)}\n\n/* ---------- footer ---------- */\nfooter{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:38px 0 52px}\n.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}\n.foot .mono{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#6a4e69;text-transform:uppercase}\n.flinks{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.flinks a{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n.flinks a:hover{color:var(--green)}\n\n@media (max-width:1080px){\n  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:44px}\n  .hero{min-height:auto;padding:56px 0 40px}\n  .nav-links{display:none}\n  .thead{display:none}\n  .trow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 16px}\n  .time{text-align:left}\n}\n@media (max-width:640px){\n  .wrap{padding:0 18px}\n  .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  .card{padding:16px}\n  .amt{font-size:27px}\n  .nav-right .chip{display:none}\n  .trow{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#2ee6c5;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Syne\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"bridge\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/bolt-diy.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>P</i>PORTAL</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Bridge</a><a href=\"#\">Routes</a><a href=\"#\">History</a><a href=\"#\">Docs</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Open the portal</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>Cross-chain bridge · Robinhood Chain</span><h1><em>PORTAL</em></h1><p>Fly your assets from Ethereum to Robinhood Chain in one move.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Open the portal</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  \n</section>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('[data-trc]'),s=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-s'),d=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-dots i'),n=r.querySelector('.trc-dots span'),k=0;\nfunction go(i){k=i%s.length;s.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});d.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});if(n)n.textContent='0'+(k+1)+' / 0'+s.length}\nvar h=/#s(\\d)/.exec(location.hash);if(h)go(+h[1]-1);else if(s.length>1)setInterval(function(){go(k+1)},5200);}());</script>\n<!--/tr-cover-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"grid-tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap nav\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <svg class=\"mark\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <ellipse cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"7\" ry=\"11.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6414ff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <ellipse cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"11.5\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff5b7f\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" opacity=\".8\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#6414ff\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <b>PORTAL</b>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"on\">Bridge</a>\n      <a href=\"#transfers\">Transfers</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Liquidity</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Relayers</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Docs</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"nav-right\">\n      <span class=\"chip mono\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> RELAY&nbsp;ONLINE · 14&nbsp;VALIDATORS</span>\n      <button class=\"btn ghost\">0x7F…A3c9</button>\n      <button class=\"btn\">Connect</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n    <!-- LEFT -->\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> Mainnet v3 · Sub-90 second finality</span>\n      <h1>Move value<br><span class=\"glow\">through the</span><br><span class=\"out\">portal.</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">A cross-chain bridge built for traders who don't wait. Lock on Ethereum, mint on Robinhood Chain — one signature, optimistic relay, canonical assets on the other side.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"terminal\">\n        <div><span>›</span> portal route --from eth --to hood --asset USDC</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:6px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;hops<span>:</span> 2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; relayer<span class=\"b\">:</span> <span class=\"b\">flux-07</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; est<span>:</span> <span>00:47</span></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:6px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;status<span>:</span> <span>ROUTE_OPTIMAL</span> <span class=\"caret\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat\"><b class=\"green\">$4.82B</b><span>Volume bridged</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><b class=\"blue\">47s</b><span>Median transfer</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><b>1.29M</b><span>Transfers settled</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT: SWAP CARD -->\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"swapCard\">\n      <div class=\"card-head\">\n        <h2>Bridge Assets</h2>\n        <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n          <button class=\"tab on\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Bridge</button>\n          <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Swap + Bridge</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- FROM -->\n      <div class=\"panel\" id=\"fromPanel\">\n        <div class=\"panel-top\">\n          <span>From</span>\n          <span class=\"net\" id=\"fromNet\">\n            <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 5 12.2 12 16l7-3.8L12 2Z\" fill=\"#ff5b7f\"/><path d=\"m12 17.5-7-3.9L12 22l7-8.4-7 3.9Z\" fill=\"#6414ff\"/></svg>\n            <span id=\"fromNetName\">Ethereum</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel-row\">\n          <input class=\"amt\" id=\"amtIn\" inputmode=\"decimal\" value=\"2.5\" aria-label=\"Amount to bridge\">\n          <div class=\"sel\">\n            <button class=\"sel-btn\" id=\"fromSelBtn\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n              <span class=\"tkn\" id=\"fromTknIcon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(140deg,#ff5b7f,#c02a44)\">ETH</span>\n              <span id=\"fromTknName\">ETH</span>\n              <svg class=\"cv\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\"><path d=\"M2 4l4 4 4-4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"menu\" id=\"fromMenu\" role=\"listbox\">\n              <div class=\"mhead\">Select asset · Ethereum</div>\n              <ul id=\"fromList\"></ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel-foot\">\n          <span id=\"fromUsd\">≈ $7,806.25</span>\n          <span>Balance: <span id=\"fromBal\">6.4182</span> <button class=\"max\" id=\"maxBtn\">MAX</button></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flip-row\">\n        <button class=\"flip\" id=\"flipBtn\" title=\"Reverse direction\" aria-label=\"Reverse direction\">\n          <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 3v14m0 0-3.5-3.5M7 17l3.5-3.5\"/><path d=\"M17 21V7m0 0-3.5 3.5M17 7l3.5 3.5\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- TO -->\n      <div class=\"panel to\" id=\"toPanel\">\n        <div class=\"panel-top\">\n          <span>To</span>\n          <span class=\"net\" id=\"toNet\">\n            <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6414ff\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><path d=\"M8 15.5 12 8l4 7.5\" stroke=\"#6414ff\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n            <span id=\"toNetName\">Robinhood Chain</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel-row\">\n          <input class=\"amt read\" id=\"amtOut\" value=\"2.4962\" readonly aria-label=\"Amount received\">\n          <div class=\"sel\">\n            <button class=\"sel-btn\" id=\"toSelBtn\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n              <span class=\"tkn\" id=\"toTknIcon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(140deg,#6414ff,#4306a8)\">ETH</span>\n              <span id=\"toTknName\">ETH</span>\n              <svg class=\"cv\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\"><path d=\"M2 4l4 4 4-4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"menu\" id=\"toMenu\" role=\"listbox\">\n              <div class=\"mhead\">Receive asset · Robinhood Chain</div>\n              <ul id=\"toList\"></ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"panel-foot\">\n          <span id=\"toUsd\">≈ $7,794.38</span>\n          <span>Recipient: <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:#ffbfce\">0x7F…A3c9</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ROUTE VISUALIZATION -->\n      <div class=\"route\">\n        <div class=\"route-head\"><span>Route</span><b id=\"routeMeta\">2 hops · relayer flux-07</b></div>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 88\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Route from Ethereum through Portal relay to Robinhood Chain\">\n          <defs>\n            <linearGradient id=\"pathGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\">\n              <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#ff5b7f\"/><stop offset=\"55%\" stop-color=\"#6414ff\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#6414ff\"/>\n            </linearGradient>\n            <filter id=\"bloom\" x=\"-60%\" y=\"-260%\" width=\"220%\" height=\"620%\">\n              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"4.2\" result=\"b\"/>\n              <feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"b\"/><feMergeNode in=\"b\"/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"/></feMerge>\n            </filter>\n          </defs>\n\n          <path id=\"rp\" d=\"M46 40 C 150 40, 160 40, 260 40 S 380 40, 474 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#pathGrad)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" opacity=\".35\"/>\n          <path d=\"M46 40 C 150 40, 160 40, 260 40 S 380 40, 474 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#pathGrad)\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"\n                stroke-dasharray=\"26 300\" filter=\"url(#bloom)\">\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"326\" to=\"0\" dur=\"2.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n          </path>\n\n          <g filter=\"url(#bloom)\">\n            <circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"40\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0b050a\" stroke=\"#ff5b7f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"40\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#0b050a\" stroke=\"#6414ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"474\" cy=\"40\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0b050a\" stroke=\"#6414ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          </g>\n          <circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ff5b7f\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"474\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#6414ff\"/>\n          <g transform=\"translate(260,40)\">\n            <circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#6414ff\"><animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"3;5.4;3\" dur=\"2.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></circle>\n            <circle r=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6414ff\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".45\">\n              <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"12;24\" dur=\"2.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n              <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\".5;0\" dur=\"2.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n            </circle>\n          </g>\n\n          <text class=\"node-label\" x=\"46\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"svgFrom\">ETHEREUM</text>\n          <text class=\"node-label hi\" x=\"260\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PORTAL RELAY</text>\n          <text class=\"node-label\" x=\"474\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"svgTo\">ROBINHOOD</text>\n          <text class=\"node-label\" x=\"153\" y=\"27\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:#7a5d79\">lock</text>\n          <text class=\"node-label\" x=\"367\" y=\"27\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:#7a5d79\">mint</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"details\">\n        <div class=\"drow\"><span>Rate</span><b id=\"rateRow\">1 ETH = 0.99850 ETH.h</b></div>\n        <div class=\"drow\"><span>Bridge fee (0.06%)</span><b id=\"feeRow\">0.0015 ETH · $4.68</b></div>\n        <div class=\"drow\"><span>Destination gas</span><b class=\"g\">Sponsored</b></div>\n        <div class=\"drow\"><span>Estimated arrival</span><b id=\"etaRow\">~47 seconds</b></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn cta\" id=\"bridgeBtn\">Open Portal · Bridge 2.5 ETH</button>\n      <p class=\"note\">Signature required · Slippage 0.10% · Nonce 41,829</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"marquee\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"mq-track\" id=\"mq\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"transfers\" id=\"transfers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Recent transfers</h2>\n        <p>Live relay feed · block 21,480,914</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filters\">\n        <button class=\"tab on\">All</button>\n        <button class=\"tab\">Mine</button>\n        <button class=\"tab\">Relaying</button>\n        <button class=\"tab\">Settled</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table\" id=\"table\">\n      <div class=\"thead\">\n        <span>Transfer ID</span><span>Route</span><span>Amount</span><span>Status</span><span style=\"text-align:right\">Age</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"trow\">\n        <div class=\"hash\">0x9c4a…71f2<small>Relayer flux-07</small></div>\n        <div class=\"path\">Ethereum <span class=\"arrow\">──▶</span> Robinhood</div>\n        <div class=\"amount\">12,400.00 USDC<small>$12,400.00</small></div>\n        <div><span class=\"badge live\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> Relaying</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">18s ago</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"trow\">\n        <div class=\"hash\">0x3ef0…c8ad<small>Relayer nova-02</small></div>\n        <div class=\"path\">Ethereum <span class=\"arrow\">──▶</span> Robinhood</div>\n        <div class=\"amount\">4.2100 ETH<small>$13,145.52</small></div>\n        <div><span class=\"badge ok\">✓ Settled</span></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">1m 04s ago</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"trow\">\n        <div class=\"hash\">0xb71d…4409<small>Relayer flux-07</small></div>\n        <div class=\"path\">Robinhood <span class=\"arrow\">──▶</span> Ethereum</div>\n        <div class=\"amount\">0.3840 WBTC<small>$23,961.60</small></div>\n        <div><span class=\"badge ok\">✓ Settled</span></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">2m 31s ago</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"trow\">\n        <div class=\"hash\">0x55c9…e013<small>Relayer orbit-11</small></div>\n        <div class=\"path\">Ethereum <span class=\"arrow\">──▶</span> Robinhood</div>\n        <div class=\"amount\">86,000.00 USDT<small>$85,982.00</small></div>\n        <div><span class=\"badge live\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> Attesting</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:24%\"></i></div></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">3m 12s ago</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"trow\">\n        <div class=\"hash\">0x1a88…7d5e<small>Relayer nova-02</small></div>\n        <div class=\"path\">Ethereum <span class=\"arrow\">──▶</span> Robinhood</div>\n        <div class=\"amount\">1,250.00 HOOD<small>$30,750.00</small></div>\n        <div><span class=\"badge ok\">✓ Settled</span></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">4m 48s ago</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"trow\">\n        <div class=\"hash\">0xd402…9bb1<small>Relayer flux-07</small></div>\n        <div class=\"path\">Robinhood <span class=\"arrow\">──▶</span> Ethereum</div>\n        <div class=\"amount\">18.9000 ETH<small>$58,996.80</small></div>\n        <div><span class=\"badge ok\">✓ Settled</span></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">6m 02s ago</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap foot\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <svg class=\"mark\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <ellipse cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"7\" ry=\"11.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6414ff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <ellipse cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"11.5\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff5b7f\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"mono\">PORTAL PROTOCOL © 2025 · AUDITED BY SPEARBIT + ZELLIC</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flinks\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Status</a><a href=\"#\">Security</a><a href=\"#\">Bug bounty</a><a href=\"#\">Github</a><a href=\"#\">Discord</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  const TOKENS = {\n    ETH:{sym:'ETH', name:'Ether', price:3122.5, bal:'6.4182', c1:'#ff5b7f', c2:'#c02a44'},\n    USDC:{sym:'USDC', name:'USD Coin', price:1, bal:'48,210.44', c1:'#ff5b7f', c2:'#ae1f37'},\n    USDT:{sym:'USDT', name:'Tether', price:0.9998, bal:'12,004.90', c1:'#6414ff', c2:'#4306a8'},\n    WBTC:{sym:'WBTC', name:'Wrapped BTC', price:62400, bal:'0.9120', c1:'#6414ff', c2:'#420a93'},\n    HOOD:{sym:'HOOD', name:'Robinhood', price:24.6, bal:'3,180.00', c1:'#6414ff', c2:'#4306a8'}\n  };\n  const order = ['ETH','USDC','USDT','WBTC','HOOD'];\n  const $ = s => document.querySelector(s);\n  let from = 'ETH', to = 'ETH', reversed = false;\n\n  function iconHTML(k, dest){\n    const t = TOKENS[k];\n    return {bg:`linear-gradient(140deg,${dest?'#6414ff':t.c1},${dest?'#4306a8':t.c2})`, label:t.sym.slice(0,4)};\n  }\n  function fmt(n, d){ return n.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:d,maximumFractionDigits:d}); }\n  function usd(n){ return '≈ $'+n.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2}); }\n\n  function buildList(ul, dest){\n    ul.innerHTML = order.map(k=>{\n      const t = TOKENS[k], ic = iconHTML(k,dest);\n      return `<li data-k=\"${k}\" role=\"option\"><span class=\"tkn\" style=\"background:${ic.bg}\">${ic.label}</span>\n        <span><b style=\"font-weight:600\">${t.sym}${dest?'.h':''}</b><br><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:10px;color:#967e94\">${t.name}</span></span>\n        <small>${t.bal}</small></li>`;\n    }).join('');\n  }\n  buildList($('#fromList'), false);\n  buildList($('#toList'), true);\n\n  function setToken(side, k){\n    const dest = side==='to';\n    const ic = iconHTML(k, dest);\n    $(dest?'#toTknIcon':'#fromTknIcon').style.background = ic.bg;\n    $(dest?'#toTknIcon':'#fromTknIcon').textContent = ic.label;\n    $(dest?'#toTknName':'#fromTknName').textContent = TOKENS[k].sym + (dest?'.h':'');\n    if(dest){ to = k; } else { from = k; to = k; setToken('to', k); $('#fromBal').textContent = TOKENS[k].bal; }\n    calc();\n  }\n\n  function calc(){\n    const v = parseFloat(String($('#amtIn').value).replace(/,/g,'')) || 0;\n    const out = v * 0.9985;\n    const t = TOKENS[from];\n    const dec = t.price > 1000 ? 4 : (t.price > 10 ? 4 : 2);\n    $('#amtOut').value = out ? fmt(out, dec) : '0.00';\n    $('#fromUsd').textContent = usd(v * t.price);\n    $('#toUsd').textContent = usd(out * t.price);\n    $('#rateRow').innerHTML = `1 ${t.sym} = 0.99850 ${TOKENS[to].sym}${reversed?'':'.h'}`;\n    $('#feeRow').textContent = `${fmt(v*0.0015, 4)} ${t.sym} · $${fmt(v*0.0015*t.price,2)}`;\n    $('#bridgeBtn').textContent = v ? `Open Portal · Bridge ${fmt(v, dec)} ${t.sym}` : 'Enter an amount';\n    $('#bridgeBtn').style.filter = v ? '' : 'grayscale(.7) opacity(.55)';\n    const eta = 42 + Math.round(Math.min(v * t.price / 12000, 1) * 26);\n    $('#etaRow').textContent = `~${eta} seconds`;\n  }\n\n  // dropdowns\n  function wire(btnSel, menuSel, side){\n    const btn = $(btnSel), menu = $(menuSel);\n    btn.addEventListener('click', e=>{\n      e.stopPropagation();\n      document.querySelectorAll('.menu').forEach(m=>{ if(m!==menu) m.classList.remove('open'); });\n      const open = menu.classList.toggle('open');\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open);\n    });\n    menu.addEventListener('click', e=>{\n      const li = e.target.closest('li'); if(!li) return;\n      setToken(side, li.dataset.k);\n      menu.classList.remove('open'); btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');\n    });\n  }\n  wire('#fromSelBtn','#fromMenu','from');\n  wire('#toSelBtn','#toMenu','to');\n  document.addEventListener('click', ()=> document.querySelectorAll('.menu').forEach(m=>m.classList.remove('open')));\n\n  $('#amtIn').addEventListener('input', calc);\n  $('#maxBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ $('#amtIn').value = TOKENS[from].bal.replace(/,/g,''); calc(); });\n\n  // flip direction\n  $('#flipBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){\n    reversed = !reversed;\n    this.classList.toggle('spin');\n    const a = reversed ? 'Robinhood Chain' : 'Ethereum';\n    const b = reversed ? 'Ethereum' : 'Robinhood Chain';\n    $('#fromNetName').textContent = a;\n    $('#toNetName').textContent = b;\n    $('#svgFrom').textContent = reversed ? 'ROBINHOOD' : 'ETHEREUM';\n    $('#svgTo').textContent = reversed ? 'ETHEREUM' : 'ROBINHOOD';\n    $('#routeMeta').textContent = reversed ? '2 hops · relayer nova-02' : '2 hops · relayer flux-07';\n    calc();\n  });\n\n  // CTA feedback\n  $('#bridgeBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){\n    const original = this.textContent;\n    this.textContent = 'Signing… → Locking → Relaying';\n    setTimeout(()=>{ this.textContent = '✓ Transfer submitted · 0x9c4a…71f2'; }, 1100);\n    setTimeout(()=>{ this.textContent = original; }, 3200);\n  });\n\n  // marquee\n  const items = [\n    'ETH <b>$3,122.50</b> <i>+2.4%</i>','HOOD <b>$24.60</b> <i>+6.1%</i>','TVL <b>$812.4M</b>',\n    'RELAY LATENCY <b>0.9s</b>','WBTC <b>$62,400</b> <i>-0.8%</i>','ATTESTORS <b>14/14 ONLINE</b>',\n    'BRIDGE FEE <b>0.06%</b>','USDC LIQUIDITY <b>$204.7M</b>','QUEUE DEPTH <b>3 TX</b>'\n  ];\n  const mq = $('#mq');\n  const html = items.map(i=>`<span>${i}</span>`).join('');\n  mq.innerHTML = html + html;\n\n  // live-ish updates in the feed\n  const times = document.querySelectorAll('.trow .time');\n  const bars = document.querySelectorAll('.bar i');\n  setInterval(()=>{\n    bars.forEach(b=>{\n      let w = parseFloat(b.style.width);\n      w = w >= 98 ? 12 : w + Math.random()*5;\n      b.style.width = w.toFixed(0)+'%';\n    });\n  }, 1400);\n\n  calc();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "at": 1790349878592}]}